# Commit Attribution

This repository attributes all published work to the human owner only.

When creating commits or pull requests:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by` / `Co-Authored-By` trailers for Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, Anthropic, or OpenAI.
- Do **not** add `Made-with: Cursor`, `Claude-Session`, `Generated with Claude Code`, or similar attribution lines.
- Write commit messages with only the human-authored summary. No AI tool signatures or trailers.

The `.githooks/prepare-commit-msg` hook removes any AI attribution that slips through.
